scenario 2
tick_rate 60
# The world view never stops the game: from the Rogue Encampment the
# player takes the waypoint to the Cold Plains, then warps to the Blood
# Moor; after each the game still runs and the view draws a frame with
# map tiles, with no frame skipped.
name view-warp-act1
seed 1234
end 420
char class 1
char level 30
char area 0 1
at 0 dev god on
at 0 dev waypoints
at 1 poke goto unit 2:119
at 4 msg InteractWithEntity type=2 id=@2:119
at 12 msg TakeOrCloseWp wp=@2:119 level=3
by 150 check player.area == 3
at 180 check client.view.tiles > 0
at 180 check client.view.tick changes
at 180 check client.view.skipped == 0
at 200 poke warp 2
by 350 check player.area == 2
at 400 check client.view.tiles > 0
at 400 check client.view.tick changes
at 400 check client.view.skipped == 0
